Installation requirements
=========================

* Git 2.20 or newer (with git-sh-setup in $(git --exec-path))
* POSIX shell (/bin/sh)
* prove (Perl Test::Harness) for running tests — optional

Quick install
-------------

    make install PREFIX=~/.local

This installs `git-smv` into `$(PREFIX)/bin` and libraries into
`$(PREFIX)/share/git-smv/lib/` (required at runtime).

Ensure ~/.local/bin is on your PATH, then:

    git smv help
    git help smv

System-wide exec-path install (optional, may require root):

    make install-exec
